WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.364
Switch from Fast Research to Deep Research for a sourced report.

00:00:02.364 --> 00:00:04.764
Ask for a comparison grounded in official documentation and original papers.

00:00:04.764 --> 00:00:07.112
Start Deep Research and continue working while the report is prepared.

00:00:07.112 --> 00:00:10.615
Open the completed Deep Research report and examine its citations.

00:00:10.615 --> 00:00:13.127
Inspect the cited and not-cited lists; source quality still needs review.

00:00:13.127 --> 00:00:15.903
Keep the report selected while deselecting its supporting sources.

00:00:15.903 --> 00:00:19.406
Import the completed research report as a separate source.
